``\n\nChange the `except Exception: pass` to log the error to the activity log. The `_log_activity` method won't exist yet during `_build_ui` (it's created later), so instead use a deferred approach. Replace the bare `except` with:\n\n```python\n        except Exception as exc:\n            # Deferred log -- _log is built after this in _build_activity_log\n            self._context_bar_error = str(exc)\n```\n\nThen in `_build_ui`, AFTER the line `layout.addWidget(self._build_activity_log())` (~line 488), add:\n\n```python\n        # Surface any context bar init failure\n        if getattr(self, \"_context_bar_error\", None):\n            QtCore.QTimer.singleShot(\n                100, lambda: self._log_activity(\n                    \"Context bar couldn't load: {}\".format(self._context_bar_error),\n                    \"warning\",\n                )\n            )\n```\n\n## Rules\n- Read the file first to confirm exact line content before editing\n- Make minimal, surgical edits only\n- Do NOT touch any other files\n- Do NOT sync to deployed copies (the orchestrator handles that)\n"},"uuid":"4a2788a9-8278-4a7c-bbfd-4dee4e223e97","timestamp":"2026-03-05T15:44:52.200Z"}
